  "tagline": "Pure-Go full-text, geo and vector indexing library from Couchbase.",
  "description": "Bleve is a full-text search and indexing library for Go, created and maintained largely by Couchbase, where it powers Couchbase Server's Search Service. It indexes Go structs or JSON with configurable analyzers, supports term, phrase, fuzzy, numeric range, date and geo queries, faceting and highlighting, and uses the segment-based 'scorch' index format. Vector search was added in v2.4 via FAISS bindings (built with a vectors build tag). It is the most complete native-Go option for embedding search into a Go service.",
